# The private half of the OTA code-signing key pair. The certificate beside it
# (apps/mobile/certs/) is public and committed — this is what proves an update
# came from us, and it belongs in a password manager and a GitHub environment
# secret, never here. `codesigning:generate` writes both keys into this
# directory, and the public one is only kept because the CLI's
# `codesigning:configure` wants to see it; neither is needed to build.
apps/mobile/keys/
# Uploaded attachments. UPLOADS_DIR is unset in dev, so storage.ts
# falls back to <cwd>/uploads — i.e. inside the working tree. These are
# real user images and must never be committed.
apps/server/uploads/
uploads/

# `go build` with no -o drops a binary named after the module in the package
# directory; build.sh always writes to an explicit output dir instead.
/infra/tsnet-proxy/tsnet-proxy

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
